                                                "sense_id": "3588d3bd-9ccd-37fc-a6c2-844252e6cc5c",
                                                "text": "The head of an agricultural producers’ cooperative in Chien-shih county of Hupei Province lectured his peasant wife: “To gain emancipation, women must do production work just like men.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebf6d791-8ee3-42b2-9c75-11bef69f09f2",
                                                "sense_id": "3588d3bd-9ccd-37fc-a6c2-844252e6cc5c",
                                                "text": "Among wholesalers, voluntary and cooperatives carry a far wider range and number of items in private brands than do unaffiliateds."
